  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcSign .NET: XAdES, PAdES, CAdES, XMLDSig, ASiC, Authenticode, ClickOnce, NuGet and VSIX signing, with the e-invoicing profiles (VeriFactu, TicketBAI, Facturae B2B, FatturaPA, KSeF, Factur-X and more). Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a paid licence. Ships the complete feature set with no functional limits and shows a brief one-time startup notice. https://www.esegece.com",
